<<~ ahu slot=`#/purpose`>>

`_scheduleUnlinkByTitle` settles every home a dropped carrier left in each mirror whose bag no longer holds it. `settleShadow` and `lowerShadowAt` keep the `.kapae` shadow following the layer. The DAM checklist (<<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lararium/mesh/disk-projector-dam`>>) carries its observations.

